[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7560.229, "timestamp": "02:06:00", "text": "但我只能下载到文件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7562.47, "timestamp": "02:06:02", "text": "速度，不是上传速度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7564.229, "timestamp": "02:06:04", "text": "他们会说：“啊，原来是那个东西。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7565.75, "timestamp": "02:06:05", "text": "“那玩意儿。”他们就像是这么说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7568.07, "timestamp": "02:06:08", "text": "我脑子里出现了煤气灯效应之类的东西。他们开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7569.75, "timestamp": "02:06:09", "text": "他们对我进行精神操控，然后说：“哦，那不是真的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7572.39, "timestamp": "02:06:12", "text": "先生，请从我们的网站联系我们。那是给那个的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7576.35, "timestamp": "02:06:16", "text": "你的问题。重启路由器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7579.589, "timestamp": "02:06:19", "text": "兄弟。” 我心想，“好吧，老天爷啊。” 所以，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7582.565, "timestamp": "02:06:22", "author": "@PanditJi.Y", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dbuBEqO3mJ9DX4Uu_LhA4jdzC_POgn5GfeMyztO06j5c73okFxwnXUaKWurMIj0mYXB_y53S_Q=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "helo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7582.83, "timestamp": "02:06:22", "text": "这就是我没装光纤的原因，呃，Geo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7593.75, "timestamp": "02:06:33", "text": "感觉一切都很好。是的。我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7596.87, "timestamp": "02:06:36", "text": "和其他很多网络服务提供商一样尝试过。为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7598.669, "timestamp": "02:06:38", "text": "是BSNL"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7603.51, "timestamp": "02:06:43", "text": "首先，就像大家一样，是的。而且它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7606.149, "timestamp": "02:06:46", "text": "速度超级慢。然后我问爸爸"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7608.55, "timestamp": "02:06:48", "text": "换个别的吧。这就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7610.79, "timestamp": "02:06:50", "text": "私营公司，我意识到他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7613.189, "timestamp": "02:06:53", "text": "上传速度会受到限制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7617.189, "timestamp": "02:06:57", "text": "现在会少一些，是的，即使"}]